<section class="nc-why nc-reveal" id="why" aria-labelledby="why-title">
  <div class="nc-why__container">
    <div class="nc-badge">The Problem</div>
    <h2 class="nc-why__title" id="why-title">From <span class="nc-why__highlight">1 pound</span> to <span class="nc-why__highlight">152 pounds</span> per year</h2>
    <p class="nc-why__subtitle">200 years ago, the average American consumed about 1 pound of sugar per year. Today, it's 152 pounds. Processed sugar is in everything — cereal, bread, sauces, yogurt, drinks — and it's driving metabolic dysfunction before most people even realize there's a problem.</p>
    <div class="nc-why__stats">
      <div class="nc-why__stat">
        <span class="nc-why__stat-number">152 lbs</span>
        <span class="nc-why__stat-label">Processed sugar consumed per American per year</span>
      </div>
      <div class="nc-why__stat">
        <span class="nc-why__stat-number">73%</span>
        <span class="nc-why__stat-label">Of packaged foods contain added sugar</span>
      </div>
      <div class="nc-why__stat">
        <span class="nc-why__stat-number">88%</span>
        <span class="nc-why__stat-label">Of Americans are metabolically unhealthy</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <button class="nc-btn nc-btn--primary" id="why-quiz-btn" aria-label="Take the quiz">
      Find Out Your Number <span class="nc-btn__arrow" aria-hidden="true">&#8594;</span>
    </button>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{ "name": "The Problem", "settings": [] }
{% endschema %}
